# ── Generated native projects ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This is a CNG / prebuild project: app.config.ts is the source of truth and
# android/ is derived output that scripts/build-android.sh deletes and
# regenerates on every release build. Checking it in guarantees that the tree
# and the config disagree, silently, on somebody else's machine.
#
# ANCHORED WITH A LEADING SLASH, AND THAT MATTERS ENORMOUSLY.
#
# A bare `android/` is not a path — git matches it at EVERY depth. It therefore
# also matched `modules/med-alarm/android/`, which is not generated output at
# all: it is the hand-written Kotlin alarm layer, fourteen files including the
# AlarmManager scheduling, the boot receiver and the looping alarm player. The
# most important native code in the project was invisible to `git add -A`, and
# because the repo had no commits yet nothing had surfaced it.
#
# Anchoring confines each rule to the repository root, where the generated
# projects actually live. Only the module's own build output is ignored below.
/android/
/ios/

# The local Expo module's build output — generated, unlike its src/ beside it.
modules/*/android/build/
modules/*/android/.cxx/
modules/*/android/.gradle/

# ── Build artifacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
build-output/
*.apk
*.aab

# ── Signing material — NEVER commit ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Losing this keystore means the next build cannot update the app in place, and
# the only remaining path is uninstall + reinstall, which erases the only copy
# of the user's health history. Committing it is the other half of that
# disaster: anyone with the repo can then sign an APK that Android will happily
# install over the real one. See docs/SIGNING.md.
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.p8
*.mobileprovision
keystore.properties

# ── Secrets / environment ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ── Dependencies & caches ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.expo/
.expo-shared/
dist/
web-build/
*.tsbuildinfo
.eslintcache

# ── Dev database dumps produced by scripts/seed-dev-data.ts ──────────────────
*.dev.db
*.dev.db-wal
*.dev.db-shm

# ── OS / editor noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
